Abstract: <img src="src/images/gdi-logo.svg" alt="GDI-logo" title="GDI-logo" width="300"> <br><br>The GDI Harmonised Minimal Data Model (HMD) defines a common structure for describing genomic datasets and related information within the Genomic Data Infrastructure (GDI). It specifies the main entities and their relationships, supporting consistent representation, exchange, integration, and discovery of genomic data across infrastructures.

Markup Shorthands: markdown yes, css no
